From c027584c84b083551dfa2c71c55c02c264a34274 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 22 Jul 2026 07:58:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 21/33] extensions: amd-event-log: add AEL runtime metadata

Add glue code to derive AEL metadata from LUT-backed
AFID lookups and contribute the resulting AMD-specific
metadata through the runtime metadata provider
framework.

Generated metadata includes schema version, AFID, and
associated FRU information.

Change-Id: Id69572699f6f84b787ad046fa05c0549e7e0db96
Signed-off-by: Jayanth Othayoth <ojayanth@gmail.com>
